#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A BMC account with the ReadOnly role. The plugin never needs a role that can change BMC state."
msgstr "Kaonty BMC manana ny andraikitra ReadOnly. Tsy mila andraikitra afaka manova ny toetry ny BMC mihitsy ny plugin."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A password is stored. Leave blank to keep it."
msgstr "Misy tenimiafina voatahiry. Avelao ho banga mba hitazomana azy."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "Stored encrypted with the vault key."
msgstr "Voatahiry voasokitra miafina miaraka amin'ny fanalahidin'ny fitehirizana."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed completely. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Tsy tafapetraka tanteraka ny môdely Redfish. Avereno apetraka avy ao amin'ny pejy BMC Redfish izy ireo."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, polled by poller %d, with availability checks off. Its host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Fitaovana \"%s\" avy amin'ny môdely fitaovana %s, angonin'ny poller %d, miaraka amin'ny fanamarinana fahafahana mifandray maty. Ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano azy dia anarana voatokana izay tsy ifandraisana mihitsy."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query \"%s\", with a graph for each of the %d members known now."
msgstr "Ny fangatahana angona \"%s\", misy grafika ho an'ny tsirairay amin'ireo mpikambana %d fantatra ankehitriny."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d fans or power supplies that were present are no longer reported. They count as failed until you confirm; confirming accepts the members the BMC reports now."
msgstr "Mpankafy na famatsiana herinaratra %d izay nisy teo aloha dia tsy voatatitra intsony. Isaina ho simba izy ireo mandra-panamafisanao; ny fanamafisana dia manaiky ireo mpikambana taterin'ny BMC ankehitriny."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The graph \"%s\", with its \"%s\" data source."
msgstr "Ny grafika \"%s\", miaraka amin'ny loharanon'angona \"%s\"."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "Efa mifandray amin'ny fitaovana iray ny BMC."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Redfish plugin for BMC %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Noforonin'ny plugin Redfish ho an'ny BMC %s. Ny sandany dia avy amin'ny tahiry vonjimaikan'ny plugin; ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano dia anarana voatokana izay tsy ifandraisana mihitsy."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "Cacti refused to create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Nanda tsy hamorona ny fitaovana i Cacti. Jereo ny firaketana Cacti."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The new device would be hidden from you by your device permissions, so it was removed again. Ask an administrator to grant access, or map the BMC to a device you can see."
msgstr "Ho nafenina taminao noho ny fahazoan-dalana fitaovana anananao ilay fitaovana vaovao, ka nesorina indray. Mangataha amin'ny mpitantana mba hanome alalana, na ampifandraiso amin'ny fitaovana hitanao ny BMC."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC was mapped to a device by someone else meanwhile, or could not be mapped, so the new device was removed again. Reload the page and check its mapping."
msgstr "Nampifandraisin'olon-kafa tamin'ny fitaovana ny BMC nandritra izany, na tsy azo nampifandraisina, ka nesorina indray ilay fitaovana vaovao. Avereno alefa ny pejy ary jereo ny fifandraisany."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed: %s"
msgstr "Tsy afaka napetraka ny môdely Redfish: %s"

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed or not current. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Tsy tafapetraka na tsy vaovao ny môdely Redfish. Avereno apetraka avy ao amin'ny pejy BMC Redfish izy ireo."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its Cacti device was deleted. Map it to another device or create one from the BMCs page."
msgstr "%s: voafafa ny fitaovana Cacti azy. Ampifandraiso amin'ny fitaovana hafa izy na mamoròna iray avy ao amin'ny pejy BMC."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its device is polled by poller %d but the BMC is read by poller %d. Move one of them so both use the same poller, or its graphs can read as unknown."
msgstr "%s: ny fitaovany dia angonin'ny poller %d fa ny BMC dia vakin'ny poller %d. Afindrao ny iray amin'izy ireo mba hampiasa poller mitovy ny roa tonta, raha tsy izany dia mety ho tsy fantatra ny famakiana ny grafikany."

