#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Tahiry voaro fahazoan-dalana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Rakitra fanalahidin'ny tahiry voaro"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored BMC passwords. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write; the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored passwords must be entered again."
msgstr "Lalana feno mankany amin'ny fanalahidy 32-byte izay manafina ny tenimiafina BMC voatahiry. Mamoròna azy ianao tenanao, ivelan'ny fakan'ny tranonkala, azo vakian'ny mpizara tranonkala sy ny mpampiasa poller ihany, ao amin'ny lahatahiry izay i root sy io mpampiasa io ihany no afaka manoratra; ny plugin dia tsy mamorona na manoratra azy mihitsy. Ataovy dika mitovy miaraka amin'ny angona izy: raha tsy eo izy dia tsy maintsy ampidirina indray ny tenimiafina voatahiry."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Mpanangona"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Interval"
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana fanangonana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between reads of each BMC."
msgstr "Segondra eo anelanelan'ny famakiana ny BMC tsirairay."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Rediscovery Interval"
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana fikarohana indray"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between full resource discoveries of each BMC. A BMC is also rediscovered at once when a known resource disappears or changes type."
msgstr "Segondra eo anelanelan'ny fikarohana loharano feno ho an'ny BMC tsirairay. Karohina indray avy hatrany koa ny BMC rehefa misy loharano fantatra manjavona na miova karazana."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Fetram-potoana ho an'ny mpanangona"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new BMCs. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished BMCs resume on the next run."
msgstr "Segondra azon'ny fandehanana iray ataon'ny mpanangona lanina alohan'ny hijanonany tsy hanomboka BMC vaovao. Tazomy eo ambanin'ny elanelam-potoanan'ny poller izany; hitohy amin'ny fandehanana manaraka ny BMC tsy vita."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "BMCs read in parallel. Each BMC is read by one worker at a time."
msgstr "BMC vakiana miaraka. Ny BMC tsirairay dia vakin'ny mpiasa iray isaky ny mandeha."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Workers"
msgstr "Mpiasan'ny mpanangona"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Fetram-potoana fifandraisana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for the TCP connection and TLS handshake to a BMC."
msgstr "Segondra omena ho an'ny fifandraisana TCP sy ny fifandraisan-tanana TLS amin'ny BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr "Fetram-potoanan'ny fangatahana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for one whole request to a BMC, including the connection."
msgstr "Segondra omena ho an'ny fangatahana iray manontolo amin'ny BMC, ao anatin'izany ny fifandraisana."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB accepted in one BMC response body; a larger response is refused."
msgstr "KiB ekena ao amin'ny vatan'ny valiny iray avy amin'ny BMC; lavina ny valiny lehibe kokoa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response Size"
msgstr "Haben'ny valiny farafahabetsany"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Fahavaozana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is shown as delayed."
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana fanangonana aorian'izay ny famakiana dia aseho ho tara."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delayed After"
msgstr "Tara aorian'ny"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is stale and reads as unknown. Always at least one more than Delayed After."
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana fanangonana aorian'izay ny famakiana dia lany andro ary vakiana ho tsy fantatra. Mihoatra iray farafahakeliny noho ny Tara aorian'ny foana."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Lany Andro Rehefa Afaka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Fanesorana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Tazomy ny tabilaon'ny plugin rehefa manaisotra"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its BMC registry, encrypted passwords, and reading cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Uninstall never touches Cacti devices, graphs, or BMCs, including devices the plugin created."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, ny fanesorana ny plugin dia mitazona ny rejisitry ny BMC, ny tenimiafina voasokitra miafina, ary ny tahiry vonjimaikan'ny famakiana. Esory ny marika mba hamafan'ny fanesorana azy ireo. Ny fanesorana dia tsy mikitika mihitsy ny fitaovana Cacti, grafika, na BMC, ao anatin'izany ny fitaovana noforonin'ny plugin."

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against the system CA store"
msgstr "Hamarino amin'ny fitehirizana CA an'ny rafitra"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against a CA bundle file"
msgstr "Hamarino amin'ny rakitra CA bundle"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Pinned public key (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Fanalahidy ho an'ny besinimaro voatsindrona (SHA-256)"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Do not verify (unsafe)"
msgstr "Aza hamarinina (tsy azo antoka)"

